{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xinyang-e-d9d45d767704a199d27e","title":"高堂隆答陵霄鹊巢","accounts":[{"id":"xinyang-a-d9d45d767704a199d27e","label":"正文","text":"高堂隆答陵霄鹊巢","evidence":["xinyang-q-08998dcc7f53ae20f7e8","xinyang-q-4275587a9f6f8f0a357c"]}],"participants":[{"person":"mingdi-p0041","role":"答问","evidence":["xinyang-q-08998dcc7f53ae20f7e8","xinyang-q-4275587a9f6f8f0a357c"]},{"person":"wendi-p0005","role":"闻谏改容","evidence":["xinyang-q-08998dcc7f53ae20f7e8","xinyang-q-4275587a9f6f8f0a357c"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["xinyang-q-08998dcc7f53ae20f7e8","xinyang-q-4275587a9f6f8f0a357c"]},"ordering_evidence":"xinyang-q-08998dcc7f53ae20f7e8","order":5106}],"persons":[{"id":"mingdi-p0041","name":"高堂隆","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0005","name":"曹叡","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xinyang-q-08998dcc7f53ae20f7e8","section":"chapter-025","block":"b-b0de579466d6d60a719d","layer":"original","quote":"陵霄阙始构〖1〗，有鹊巢其上；帝以问隆，对曰：“《诗》云‘维鹊有巢〖2〗，维鸠居之’。今兴宫室，起陵霄阙，而鹊巢之；此宫室未成、身不得居之象也。天意若曰：‘宫室未成，将有他姓制御之。’斯乃上天之戒也。夫天道无亲，惟与善人〖3〗；不可不深防，不可不深虑。夏、商之季，皆继体也〖4〗；不钦承上天之明命〖5〗，惟谗谄是从，废德适欲；故其亡也忽焉。太戊、武丁，睹灾竦惧，祗承天戒；故其兴也勃焉。今若休罢百役，俭以足用；增崇德政，动遵帝则〖6〗；除普天之所患，兴兆民之所利；三王可四〖7〗，五帝可六〖8〗。岂惟殷宗转祸为福而已哉〖9〗！臣备腹心〖10〗苟可以繁祉圣躬〖11〗，安存社稷；臣虽灰身破族，犹生之年也；岂惮忤逆之灾，而令陛下不闻至言乎？”","section_title":"辛毗杨阜高堂隆传第二十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0056.xhtml","index":374,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":319,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xinyang-q-4275587a9f6f8f0a357c","section":"chapter-025","block":"b-f0a67c6b5d79ab437436","layer":"original","quote":"于是帝改容动色。","section_title":"辛毗杨阜高堂隆传第二十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0056.xhtml","index":375,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":8,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
